WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.400
Noura: Sierra 2, Sierra 2, this is Marshal 22, over.

2
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.200
Sierra 2: Go ahead, over.

3
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.900
Noura: Gate 4 soft ticket check.

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:25.400
Noura: A man with no ticket slipped past behind a family, heading to the security check point.

5
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Noura: Twenties, red cap, white thobe, black backpack.

6
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.400
Noura: I am staying at my post and watching him. Over.

7
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:43.400
Sierra 2: Received. Informing Security at the check point. Keep watching. Over.

